{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06810","headline":"夏月花萼楼酺宴应制 · 王昌龄","name":"夏月花萼楼酺宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"土德三元正，尧心万国同。\n汾阴备冬礼，长乐应和风。\n赐庆垂天泽，流欢旧渚宫。\n楼台生海上，箫鼓出天中。\n雾晓筵初接，宵长曲未终。\n雨随青幕合，月照舞罗空。\n玉陛分朝列，文章发圣聪。\n愚臣忝书赋，歌咏颂丝桐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06810.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06810","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}